{
  "name": "Chaos Magician",
  "type": "class",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/New%20Classes/chaos_magician_hero.png",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“Some people study magic. You are what happens when magic studies <strong>people</strong>.”</em></p><p><strong>Primary Ability:</strong> Charisma</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> Innate reality-bender who channels unstable dreamstuff straight through the Yesod–Malkuth fracture.</p><p>Chaos Magicians are living anomalies: walking probability leaks. Their casting is not a formula—it’s a persuasive event. A Chaos Magician doesn’t ask the universe for permission. They remind it that consent is complicated.</p><h3>Class Features by Tier (BBTTCC Overlay)</h3><ul><li><strong>Tier 1 — Fracture-Born.</strong> You carry the fracture inside you. Chaos surges. Small boons. Reality flinches.</li><li><strong>Tier 2 — Probability Editor.</strong> You pressure outcomes by spending Chaos Points.</li><li><strong>Tier 3 — Reality Bleed.</strong> Your victories can seal or widen the tear—Darkness and boons spill accordingly.</li><li><strong>Tier 4 — Living Paradox.</strong> Once per long rest you cast as a contradiction: maximum output, chosen surge.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
